        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;\n@startmindmap\nskinparam monochrome true\nskinparam BackgroundColor #FEFEFE\n\n* Root Problem\\n**Ineffective Dietary Adherence\\nat Campus Canteens**\n\nleft side\n\n* **Data &amp; Information**\n** Hidden ingredients &amp; oils\n** No calorie or macro labels\n** Inconsistent portion sizes\n** Lack of digital menu boards\n\n* **People &amp; Vendors**\n** Vendors unaware of nutritional values\n** Resistance to changing recipes\n** Students lack dietary literacy\n** High time pressure during lunch rush\n\nright side\n\n* **Technology &amp; Systems**\n** Manual tracking is tedious\n** Lack of personalized decision support\n** Slow app response / bad UI\n** No real-time inventory tracking\n\n* **Environment &amp; Culture**\n** Limited healthy food options\n** High availability of cheap fried foods\n** Peer pressure &amp; social eating habits\n** Busy, crowded canteen layout\n\n@endmindmap&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="5exjo6JdeYEov8RrAfWj-1">
